#: includes/Abilities/Domain/DuplicatePost.php:51
msgid ""
"Creates a copy of an existing post or page, including its content, custom "
"fields and taxonomy terms. The copy is saved as a draft (never published) "
"and its ID and edit URL are returned. Use the list-duplicatable-posts "
"ability first if you only know the title and need the ID."
